# 31. Construct Binary Tree from Preorder and Inorder

**a2z-329**

Preorder:

```text
root → left → right
```

Inorder:

```text
left → root → right
```

## Java

```java
public static TreeNode buildTree(
        int[] preorder,
        int[] inorder) {

    Map<Integer, Integer> index = new HashMap<>();

    for (int i = 0; i < inorder.length; i++)
        index.put(inorder[i], i);

    int[] preIndex = {0};

    return build(
        preorder,
        0,
        inorder.length - 1,
        preIndex,
        index
    );
}

private static TreeNode build(
        int[] preorder,
        int left,
        int right,
        int[] preIndex,
        Map<Integer, Integer> index) {

    if (left > right)
        return null;

    int value = preorder[preIndex[0]++];

    TreeNode root = new TreeNode(value);

    int mid = index.get(value);

    root.left = build(
        preorder,
        left,
        mid - 1,
        preIndex,
        index
    );

    root.right = build(
        preorder,
        mid + 1,
        right,
        preIndex,
        index
    );

    return root;
}
