# 26. Children Sum Property

**a2z-324**

Check:

```text
node.val == left.val + right.val
```

For a leaf, property is automatically satisfied.

## Java

```java
public static boolean checkChildrenSum(TreeNode root) {

    if (root == null)
        return true;

    // Leaf node.
    if (root.left == null &&
        root.right == null)
        return true;

    int sum = 0;

    if (root.left != null)
        sum += root.left.val;

    if (root.right != null)
        sum += root.right.val;

    if (root.val != sum)
        return false;

    return checkChildrenSum(root.left)
        && checkChildrenSum(root.right);
}
```

## C#

